## 10. Conclusion

CampusBite successfully demonstrates the development of a full-stack restaurant ordering and delivery platform.

The project brings together React.js, Python, FastAPI, Microsoft SQL Server and Docker to create an integrated application supporting customers, restaurant owners and delivery partners.

Through this project, practical knowledge was gained in frontend development, REST API development, database design, authentication, application integration and containerization.

CampusBite provides a foundation that can be further enhanced with additional features and cloud deployment.

